  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "xlel_wd_dictionary",
  "description": "XLEL-WD is a multilingual event linking dataset. This sub-dataset contains a dictionary of events from Wikidata. The multilingual descriptions for Wikidata event items are taken from the corresponding Wikipedia articles.",
  "alternateName": [
    "adithya7/xlel_wd_dictionary",
    "XLEL-WD is a multilingual event linking dataset. This supplementary dataset contains a dictionary of event items from Wikidata. The descriptions for Wikidata event items are taken from the corresponding multilingual Wikipedia articles."
